  "description": "Plan Your Dream Day with The Knot: The #1 Rated Free Wedding Planner App\n\nNEW! Introducing The Knot's Peace of Mind Program\nPlan your wedding with total confidence thanks to The KnotΓÇÖs Peace of Mind Program. As the wedding industry's first safety net program for last-minute vendor cancellations, weΓÇÖre here to protect your big day. If an eligible vendor cancels close to your wedding date, our dedicated support team steps in to help you rebook a replacement vendor and cover up to $500 of any price difference. Say goodbye to last-minute panic and hello to stress-free planning!\n\nFrom the moment you say \"yes\" to walking down the aisle, The Knot Wedding Planner App makes planning your big day seamless, organized, and fun. Whether you need a customizable wedding countdown, a top-rated wedding registry, or an easy guest list manager, our all-in-one planning tools are here to bring your vision to life.\n\nEVERYTHING YOU NEED TO PLAN YOUR WEDDING\n\nWedding Countdown: Track the days, hours, and minutes until you say \"I do\" with a personalized, shareable countdown screen.\n\nWedding Registry: Easily create and manage your registry. Combine physical gifts, cash funds, honeymoon funds, and experiences in one place. NEW! Link a Venmo account to your cash funds so guests can give seamlessly.\n\nGuest List & RSVPs: Track responses, manage meal preferences, organize contact details, and update your guest list in real-time.\n\nWedding Venues & Vendors: Discover, compare, and message local wedding venues, photographers, florists, caterers, and bridal vendors.\n\nSave the Dates & Invitations: Browse matching stationery, digital invitations, and save-the-date cards that pair seamlessly with your wedding aesthetic.\n\nSeating Chart & Budget Tools: Keep your wedding budget on track and build interactive seating arrangements with ease.\n\nCustom Wedding Website: Share event details, schedule updates, travel info, and registry links directly with your guests.\n\nWedding Style Quiz & Inspiration: Take our Style Quiz to discover your unique wedding vision. Create a wedding inspiration board full of wedding dresses, decor, and color palettes to share with your vendors and bridal party.\n\nWHY COUPLES LOVE THE KNOT\nJoin millions of couples who trust The Knot to streamline their wedding planning journey. From finding the perfect wedding venue to sending digital invitations and managing guest list details, everything you need is right at your fingertipsΓÇö100% free.\n\nDownload The Knot: Wedding Planner App today and start planning your dream wedding!\n\nLegal & Support\n\nPrivacy Policy: https://www.theknot.com/privacy-policy\n\nTerms & Conditions: https://www.theknot.com/terms-and-conditions\n\nDo Not Sell My Info: https://theknotww.zendesk.com/hc/en-us/requests/new?ticket_form_id=360000590371\n\nCA Privacy Notice: https://www.theknotww.com/ca-collection-notice",
